# Task: Review, Refine and Finalize the Enterprise Knowledge Platform MCP Server Specification (V1)

## Background

The Enterprise Knowledge Platform architecture has already been approved.

Repository Analyzer
        ↓
Knowledge Repository (PostgreSQL + pgvector)
        ↓
Knowledge Engine
        ↓
MCP Server
        ↓
AI Workers

The following specifications already exist and should be treated as the source of truth.

- Knowledge Model
- Database Schema
- Repository Analyzer
- Ingestion Pipeline
- Retrieval & Context Engine
- Knowledge Engine API

Do NOT redesign these components.

Your task is ONLY to review and finalize the MCP Server specification.

---

# Knowledge Engine Responsibilities

The Knowledge Engine owns all business logic.

Including:

- SQL retrieval
- Hybrid retrieval
- Vector retrieval
- Relationship traversal
- Ranking
- Context Builder
- Evidence collection
- Knowledge enrichment

The MCP Server must NEVER implement these responsibilities.

The MCP Server is a thin protocol adapter exposing the Knowledge Engine APIs.

---

# AI Workers

The MCP Server will be consumed by:

- Impact Analysis Worker
- Requirement Analysis Worker
- OAS Generator
- Repository Explorer
- Architecture Assistant
- Knowledge Explorer

Derive the MCP API from the needs of these workers.

Do NOT derive MCP tools from database tables.

